{"page":239,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:31","surah":12,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا سَمِعَتْ بِمَكْرِهِنَّ أَرْسَلَتْ إِلَيْهِنَّ وَأَعْتَدَتْ لَهُنَّ مُتَّكَـًٔا وَءَاتَتْ كُلَّ وَٰحِدَةٍ مِّنْهُنَّ سِكِّينًا وَقَالَتِ ٱخْرُجْ عَلَيْهِنَّ ۖ فَلَمَّا رَأَيْنَهُۥٓ أَكْبَرْنَهُۥ وَقَطَّعْنَ أَيْدِيَهُنَّ وَقُلْنَ حَـٰشَ لِلَّهِ مَا هَـٰذَا بَشَرًا إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا مَلَكٌ كَرِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When she heard their malicious talk, she prepared a banquet and sent for them, giving each of them a knife. She said to Joseph, ‘Come out and show yourself to them!’ and when the women saw him, they were stunned by his beauty, and cut their hands, exclaiming, ‘Great God! He cannot be mortal! He must be a precious angel!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَمِعَتْ","en_gloss":"she heard","transliteration":"samiʿat","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِمَكْرِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"of their scheming","transliteration":"bimakrihinna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَرْسَلَتْ","en_gloss":"she sent","transliteration":"arsalat","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ilayhinna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَعْتَدَتْ","en_gloss":"and she prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿtadat","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahunna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُتَّكَـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"a banquet","transliteration":"muttaka-an","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَءَاتَتْ","en_gloss":"and she gave","transliteration":"waātat","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"each","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"one","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنْهُنَّ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hunna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سِكِّينًۭا","en_gloss":"a knife","transliteration":"sikkīnan","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَقَالَتِ","en_gloss":"and she said","transliteration":"waqālati","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱخْرُجْ","en_gloss":"Come out","transliteration":"ukh'ruj","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ ۖ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":18,"ar":"رَأَيْنَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"they saw him","transliteration":"ra-aynahu","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَكْبَرْنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"they greatly admired him","transliteration":"akbarnahu","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَقَطَّعْنَ","en_gloss":"and cut","transliteration":"waqaṭṭaʿna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَيْدِيَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydiyahunna","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَقُلْنَ","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"waqul'na","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":23,"ar":"حَـٰشَ","en_gloss":"Forbid","transliteration":"ḥāsha","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":24,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":26,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بَشَرًا","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"basharan","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":28,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":29,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":30,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":31,"ar":"مَلَكٌۭ","en_gloss":"an angel","transliteration":"malakun","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":32,"ar":"كَرِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"noble","transliteration":"karīmun","verse_key":"12:31"},{"pos":33,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:31"}]},{"verse_key":"12:32","surah":12,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَتْ فَذَٰلِكُنَّ ٱلَّذِى لُمْتُنَّنِى فِيهِ ۖ وَلَقَدْ رَٰوَدتُّهُۥ عَن نَّفْسِهِۦ فَٱسْتَعْصَمَ ۖ وَلَئِن لَّمْ يَفْعَلْ مَآ ءَامُرُهُۥ لَيُسْجَنَنَّ وَلَيَكُونًا مِّنَ ٱلصَّـٰغِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"She said, ‘This is the one you blamed me for. I tried to seduce him and he wanted to remain chaste, but if he does not do what I command now, he will be put in prison and degraded.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَتْ","en_gloss":"She said","transliteration":"qālat","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَذَٰلِكُنَّ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"fadhālikunna","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the one","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لُمْتُنَّنِى","en_gloss":"you blamed me","transliteration":"lum'tunnanī","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"about him","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَٰوَدتُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"I sought to seduce him","transliteration":"rāwadttuhu","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَّفْسِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[himself]","transliteration":"nafsihi","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱسْتَعْصَمَ ۖ","en_gloss":"but he saved himself","transliteration":"fa-is'taʿṣama","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَفْعَلْ","en_gloss":"he does","transliteration":"yafʿal","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَامُرُهُۥ","en_gloss":"I order him","transliteration":"āmuruhu","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَيُسْجَنَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely, he will be imprisoned","transliteration":"layus'jananna","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلَيَكُونًۭا","en_gloss":"and certainly will be","transliteration":"walayakūnan","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰغِرِينَ","en_gloss":"those who are disgraced","transliteration":"l-ṣāghirīna","verse_key":"12:32"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:32"}]},{"verse_key":"12:33","surah":12,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ رَبِّ ٱلسِّجْنُ أَحَبُّ إِلَىَّ مِمَّا يَدْعُونَنِىٓ إِلَيْهِ ۖ وَإِلَّا تَصْرِفْ عَنِّى كَيْدَهُنَّ أَصْبُ إِلَيْهِنَّ وَأَكُن مِّنَ ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Joseph said, ‘My Lord! I would prefer prison to what these women are calling me to do. If You do not protect me from their treachery, I shall yield to them and do wrong,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسِّجْنُ","en_gloss":"the prison","transliteration":"l-sij'nu","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَحَبُّ","en_gloss":"(is) dearer","transliteration":"aḥabbu","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"to me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"than what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَدْعُونَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"they invite me","transliteration":"yadʿūnanī","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِلَّا","en_gloss":"And unless","transliteration":"wa-illā","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَصْرِفْ","en_gloss":"You turn away","transliteration":"taṣrif","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَنِّى","en_gloss":"from me","transliteration":"ʿannī","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَيْدَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their plot","transliteration":"kaydahunna","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَصْبُ","en_gloss":"I might incline","transliteration":"aṣbu","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"towards them","transliteration":"ilayhinna","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَكُن","en_gloss":"and [I] be","transliteration":"wa-akun","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_gloss":"the ignorant","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","verse_key":"12:33"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:33"}]},{"verse_key":"12:34","surah":12,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَجَابَ لَهُۥ رَبُّهُۥ فَصَرَفَ عَنْهُ كَيْدَهُنَّ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and his Lord answered his prayer and protected him from their treachery- He is the All Hearing, the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱسْتَجَابَ","en_gloss":"So responded","transliteration":"fa-is'tajāba","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbuhu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَصَرَفَ","en_gloss":"and turned away","transliteration":"faṣarafa","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنْهُ","en_gloss":"from him","transliteration":"ʿanhu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَيْدَهُنَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"their plot","transliteration":"kaydahunna","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, [He]","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearer","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"12:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:34"}]},{"verse_key":"12:35","surah":12,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ بَدَا لَهُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ مَا رَأَوُا۟ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لَيَسْجُنُنَّهُۥ حَتَّىٰ حِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the end they thought it best, after seeing all the signs of his innocence, that they should imprison him for a while.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَدَا","en_gloss":"(it) appeared","transliteration":"badā","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَأَوُا۟","en_gloss":"they had seen","transliteration":"ra-awū","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَيَسْجُنُنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"surely they should imprison him","transliteration":"layasjununnahu","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"a time","transliteration":"ḥīnin","verse_key":"12:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:35"}]},{"verse_key":"12:36","surah":12,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَدَخَلَ مَعَهُ ٱلسِّجْنَ فَتَيَانِ ۖ قَالَ أَحَدُهُمَآ إِنِّىٓ أَرَىٰنِىٓ أَعْصِرُ خَمْرًا ۖ وَقَالَ ٱلْـَٔاخَرُ إِنِّىٓ أَرَىٰنِىٓ أَحْمِلُ فَوْقَ رَأْسِى خُبْزًا تَأْكُلُ ٱلطَّيْرُ مِنْهُ ۖ نَبِّئْنَا بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦٓ ۖ إِنَّا نَرَىٰكَ مِنَ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Two young men went into prison alongside him. One of them said, ‘I dreamed that I was pressing grapes’; the other said, ‘I dreamed that I was carrying bread on my head and that the birds were eating it.’ [They said], ‘